-- =============================================================================
-- SkillLink — demo seed data
-- =============================================================================
-- Populates the platform with 6 realistic mentor profiles and 9 opportunities
-- so the first real users don't land on an empty marketplace.
--
-- All demo accounts are marked so you can find and remove them cleanly:
--   - emails end in @skilllink.demo
--   - user IDs are prefixed d0000000-0000-4000-a000-...
--
-- To remove ALL demo data later (cascades to profiles + opportunities):
--   DELETE FROM auth.users WHERE email LIKE '%@skilllink.demo';
--
-- Applied to production (cprfaimmxtqsmmutdbcb) on 2026-07-19.
-- This file is the source of truth; re-running it will fail on duplicate IDs,
-- which is intentional (delete first, then re-seed).
-- =============================================================================

